SamTSE/Sources/Engine with the path prefix rewritten. All 26 files are
new and applied without conflict; content is byte-identical to the TFE
tree. Upstream (Serious-Engine-RT, Sultim Tsyrendashiev) and Croteam
notices are kept as imported.

Ported code: Serious-Engine-RT (https://github.com/sultim-t/Serious-Engine-RT,
GPL-2.0-only) by Sultim Tsyrendashiev; original copyright notices kept.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
